WEBVTT

00:08:29.712 --> 00:08:30.887
In the 21st century,

00:08:30.911 --> 00:08:33.173
you might want to expand
that just a little bit.

00:08:33.197 --> 00:08:34.442
Is the system sustainable,

00:08:34.466 --> 00:08:36.466
is it safe, is it responsible?

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:39.348
Who gets to judge those things for us?

00:08:39.372 --> 00:08:41.492
Users of the systems
would want to understand

00:08:41.516 --> 00:08:44.097
how these things are regulated,
managed and built.

00:08:45.737 --> 00:08:48.506
And then there's the final,
perhaps most critical question

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:51.347
that you need to ask
of these new AI systems.

00:08:51.989 --> 00:08:53.429
What's its intent?

00:08:53.822 --> 00:08:55.355
What's the system designed to do

00:08:55.379 --> 00:08:57.171
and who said that was a good idea?

00:08:57.195 --> 00:08:58.862
Or put another way,

00:08:58.886 --> 00:09:01.561
what is the world
that this system is building,